# Phase 2: Database-Driven Initiatives, Multi-Theme System & Admin UI Overhaul

## Goal

Three enhancements:
1. **Move all initiatives data to Supabase** — admin-manageable CRUD for initiatives & programs
2. **Add 3-4 modern themes** — switchable via UI with localStorage persistence
3. **Overhaul admin panel UI/UX** — modern sidebar, breadcrumbs, better layout

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Database migration**: A new SQL migration (`009_initiatives_and_programs.sql`) will create the `programs` and `initiatives` tables in Supabase. You'll need to **run this migration in the Supabase SQL Editor** before the admin panel can manage initiatives.

> [!WARNING]
> **Seed data**: A seed script will bulk-insert all 88 initiatives. Running it twice is safe (uses `ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE`).

---

## Proposed Changes

### A. Database — Initiatives & Programs Tables

#### [NEW] [009_initiatives_and_programs.sql](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/supabase/migrations/009_initiatives_and_programs.sql)

Creates two tables:

| Table | Columns |
|-------|---------|
| `programs` | `id (uuid)`, `code (text A-L)`, `name`, `description`, `icon`, `order_index`, `created_at`, `updated_at` |
| `initiatives` | `id (uuid)`, `title`, `slug (unique)`, `program_id (FK → programs)`, `fiscal_year`, `strategic_area`, `criticality (enum)`, `delivery_focus`, `status (draft/published)`, `order_index`, `created_at`, `updated_at` |

Plus RLS policies (public read, admin write) and indexes.

#### [NEW] [010_seed_initiatives.sql](file:///c:/Users/TEST/MyPortalSC/supabase/migrations/010_seed_initiatives.sql)

Inserts 12 programs + 88 initiatives using `ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE`.

