## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
```bash
npm run build    # TypeScript + route compilation
```

### Manual Verification
1. Run migration `009` and seed `010` in Supabase SQL Editor
2. Verify admin panel shows Initiatives sidebar link
3. Create/edit/delete an initiative from admin
4. Check public `/initiatives` page loads from DB
5. Switch between all 4 themes on the public site
6. Verify theme persists across page navigation (localStorage)
7. Test admin sidebar collapse and mobile responsiveness
